BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:13th ASCE/XE Annual Career Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T150000
UID:9ccbdf701b1fc192fdc8064f451753967142026_2:45:35_AM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:The 13th ASCE/XE Annual Career Fair will be held on October 15
 th-16th\, 2025 from 10 am-3 pm (with a one hour break for lunch from 12-1 
 pm) in the UC Davis ARC Ballrooms. The fair is FREE for students and will 
 include more than 55 civil & environmental companies looking for both inte
 rns and full time hires. Companies will be reviewing the resumes you submi
 t to determine same-day interview spots\, so make sure you submit the most
  recent version of your resume!\n\nNo RSVP needed - simply show up on the 
 day of the event. Check out ASCE's instagram page for updates and more inf
 ormation!
LOCATION:ARC Ballroom AandB\, ARC Ballroom\, Davis\, CA 95616\, Davis 9561
 6\, United States
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908931
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
